WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.600
The raiders rode south at dusk. Two men stayed behind.

2
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:12.400
The wind had packed every groove with sand. I brushed the words clean, one by one.

3
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:19.600
Seven letters in the bronze. One hundred and ninety-four degrees. The whole ruin rang like a bell.

4
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:24.600
Both of them, on their feet. They had seen my shadow on the dial.

5
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:32.400
Run south, into the walls of the old camp. Read the letters, choose the doorway.

6
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:39.200
A hollow under a fallen lintel, just wide enough for an old man folded in two.

7
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:46.500
Hoofbeats going away south, fast, the way the needle points.

8
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.900
On the cold hearth stone, burned with a hot nail: the BC Ashes.

